e the skin they take is  always that of an actual god as we can  see a normal noble ghost begging for his  skin to not be taken  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]  [Music]  so we can take from this final verse of  which in my opinion is the best ost in  all of elden ring is that the godskins  will hunt down those guided by grace  forever relentless in their pursuit of  the power that was taken from them long  ago and knowing this it makes a lot more  sense that we fight against the godskins  so many different times they are  relentlessly hunting us for our guidance  of grace and it's possible that the  godskins don't really know where  malakath is and where he has hidden  destined death and are potentially  tracking us throughout the lands between  in order to find it now this sort of  gets confusing because they attack us  multiple different times in many  different places on our journey so why  wouldn't they just fight us the one time  in pharaoh missoula once we're close to  malakath and the rune of death now this  is likely because they're trying to stop  us from uncovering other secrets that we  can find after defeating them in the  bottom of caled's divine tower we can  find an apostle guarding the godslayer's  greatsword which is a sword once used by  the glomide queen to control the  godskins and the power of the black  flame on the bridge to the carrion  divine tower we can find a godskin noble  who is likely guarding ronnie's  discarded body in one half of the curse  mark of death that we can find here as  well at the top of windmill village we  can find another apostle who is likely  just in this area to receive the skin  that the dancing ladies of windmill  village have skinned for the apostles  clothing next we can find a godskin  noble in volcano manor likely protecting  the serpent's a minion which is from a  mother's womb which cradled the poor  unwanted offspring of a repellent  birthing ritual now this could be in  reference to how the godskins are  actually born maybe how they're created  and why they have certain features that  resemble that of a serpent finally we  meet both the godskin noble and apostle  in pharah missoula likely to stop us  from taking the rune of death from  malakath so that they can do it  themselves and take back control of  destined death and restore the full  power of their black flame i made an  entire video on the gloamide queen and  destined death a little over a month ago  which goes over the theory that melania  is the gloam or dusk-eyed queen there's  still a solid amount of evidence that  supports this theory and is still what i  believe to be true obviously the largest  piece of evidence for this is during the  flame a frenzy ending where her eye  changes to a gloam color and swears that  she will deliver to us what we deserve  destined death i'm really curious of  what you guys all think about the  godskins and how they're linked to  destin death pretty much everything  we've talked about i would love to hear  your interpretation of the song and the  translation from latin to english i  really hope you guys enjoyed this video  i would call it more of a snapshot lore  hunting video than a fully flushed out  deep analysis obviously i will still be  working on those big projects along with  these snapshot lore hunting videos i  started the lore hunting series about  two months ago and it's what really  lifted my channel off of the ground so i  would like to do these videos every now  and then along with the deep analysis  lore videos so let me know what you  would all like to see next i'd like to  give another thank you to my patrons who  make videos like this possible and going  the extra mile to support my content in  the future of the channel thank you all  for watching and i'll see you in the  next video take care
 

